  "historyNote": "#1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5656, eff 7-1-93, EXPIRED: 7-1-99 New. #8555, eff 2-1-06, EXPIRED: 2-1-14 New. #11014, eff 1-8-16; ss by #14661, eff 7-23-26, EXPIRES: 7-23-36",
